/Prev 419 0 R
/SE 192 0 R
/Title (Appellees improperly conflate the prior PCA with the subsequent order under review. The June 25, 2025 PCA \(R. 13176\) affirmed the April 30, 2024 Final Summary Judgment \(R. 12436-44\) on direct appeal. It did not review or affirm the January 27, 2026 denial of Rule 1.540\(b\)\(4\) relief, which did not yet exist \(R. 14569-71\).  Florida Department of Transportation v. Juliano, 801 So. 2d 101, 108 \(Fla. 2001\).   A void judgment remains subject to collateral attack. Curbelo v. Ullman, 571 So. 2d 443, 445 \(Fla. 1990\). \(R. 13987-8\) )
>>
endobj
