/Title (Rule 1.540\(b\)\(4\) permits a collateral challenge to a judgment alleged to be void, and the law-of-the-case doctrine reaches only matters necessarily decided. Appellees have not shown that the unexplained PCA necessarily determined that Appellants received advance notice identifying DE92 for adjudication. )
>>
endobj
