/SE 201 0 R
/Title (Critically, the PCA reviewed the April 30, 2024 Final Summary Judgment \(R. 12436-44\), not the January 27, 2026 order \(R. 14569-71\) denying Rule 1.540\(b\)\(4\) relief, which did not yet exist. This is the first appeal reviewing that denial. \(R. 13986-7\) Although the different procedural posture does not itself eliminate the law of the case, Appellees must establish that the PCA necessarily resolved the specific constitutional notice issue underlying this voidness challenge. Juliano, 801 So. 2d at 108. )
>>
endobj
